  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4631,
      "text": "Qāf[1]. By the Glorious Qur’an!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4632,
      "text": "But they wonder that a warner has come to them from among themselves, so the disbelievers say, “This is something strange!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4633,
      "text": "What! Is it when we die and become dust [will we return to life]? That is a far-fetched return.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4634,
      "text": "We certainly know what the earth consumes of them [after their death], and with Us is a Preserved Record[2].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4635,
      "text": "Rather they rejected the truth when it came to them, so they are in a state of confusion[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4636,
      "text": "Have they not then looked at the sky above them – how We built it and adorned it [with stars], and it has no rifts?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4637,
      "text": "And We have spread out the earth and set therein firm mountains, and caused to grow therein plants of every pleasant kind,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4638,
      "text": "as a source of insight and a reminder to every slave who turns [to Allah].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4639,
      "text": "And We send down from the sky blessed rain, with which We cause to grow gardens and grain for harvest,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4640,
      "text": "and towering palm trees having clustered fruit,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4641,
      "text": "as a provision for people, and We revive thereby a dead land; likewise will be the resurrection.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4642,
      "text": "The people of Noah rejected [the truth] before them[4], as well as the companions of the Well[5] and Thamūd,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4643,
      "text": "and so did ‘Ād, Pharaoh, the people of Lot,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4644,
      "text": "and the dwellers of the Forest[6], and the people of Tubba‘[7]. All of them rejected the messengers, so My warning was fulfilled.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4645,
      "text": "Were We wearied by their first creation? No indeed, yet they are in confusion concerning the second creation.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 518,
      "ruku": 452,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
